---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <BaseHead title="What Happens After You Sign? | CashAsIs" description="Signed your CashAsIs agreement? See the simple next steps from title work to choosing your closing date and receiving your proceeds." />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <Nav />
  <section class="legal-hero">
    <div class="in">
      <span class="badge">Your Next Steps</span>
      <h1>What Happens After You Sign?</h1>
      <p class="meta">You sign. We handle the rest.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <main class="legal-wrap">
    <article class="legal-card article">
      <div class="article-body">
        <p>Once your agreement is signed, the process is designed to stay simple. You don't need to start fixing the house, schedule showings, or prepare it for a traditional listing. CashAsIs moves the sale toward closing while keeping you informed along the way.</p>

        <h2>1. Sign Your Agreement</h2>
        <p>Review and sign your purchase agreement. If you have a question about anything in it, ask us before signing—we want you to understand the process.</p>

        <h2>2. We Work With the Title Company</h2>
        <p>After signing, the transaction moves into title. The title company reviews ownership and works through the normal title and closing requirements. If something needs your attention, we'll let you know what is needed.</p>

        <h2>3. Choose Your Closing Timeline</h2>
        <p>We coordinate the closing around the agreed timeline. CashAsIs is built for sellers who want a straightforward sale without the traditional listing process.</p>

        <h2>4. Close & Receive Your Proceeds</h2>
        <p>At closing, the final documents are completed through the title company and the seller receives the proceeds due from the transaction.</p>

        <div class="callout">
          <p><b>No repairs. No cleaning. No commissions.</b><br />Sell the house as-is and move forward on your timeline.</p>
        </div>

        <h2>What do you need to do right now?</h2>
        <p>If your agreement is still waiting for your signature, review it when you're ready. Have a question before signing? Call or text us at <b>(346) 584-6365</b> and we'll walk through it with you.</p>

        <div class="callout">
          <p><b>Ready to move forward?</b> Review and sign the agreement we sent you. Once it's signed, we'll begin the next steps toward closing.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
  <script is:inline src="https://link.msgsndr.com/js/external-tracking.js" data-tracking-id="tk_61336d42285a45a29bdc44b9a0947ddf"></script>
</body>
</html>